    "Continue fasting" : {
      "comment" : "Primary action on the window-closed screen (.eatingOver). Starts the NEXT fast, backdated to the moment the eating window closed; the screen already shows a count-up running and its body says the time since then already counts, so the label must read as carrying on from something in progress, not as starting from zero. The object is deliberately generic — the practice, not a specific session — so do NOT add a determiner: the undetermined object is what tells this apart from \"Keep this fast\" (Reset confirmation sheet), which leaves an already-running fast untouched and changes nothing.",
