    "Footer.notNowFast" : {
      "comment" : "Secondary action on the .eatingOver footer card, beside 'Continue fasting'. The eating window has already closed; tapping clears the stored closing time and returns to idle. Nothing is skipped — this defers the next fast. Never use a skip/omit verb.",
