            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "继续保持"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep this fast" : {
      "comment" : "Safe (cancel) action in the Reset confirmation sheet, shown next to the destructive \"Reset fast\". That sheet (ResetConfirmSheet) is the only surface today; a second one — the near-goal guard in the End-fast sheet — is planned for 1.5.1. Do not name the reset operation (\"don't reset\", \"cancel reset\"): the safe half of a destructive pair must not repeat the destructive verb, and on the planned second surface there is nothing to reset. Tapping it only dismisses the sheet: the fast that is already running keeps running, and nothing is created, saved, deleted or written to history — do not use a verb that could mean \"save\", \"store\" or \"archive\". \"This fast\" is the concrete session named in the sheet title (\"Reset this fast?\"), not the practice of fasting: keep an explicit determiner unless your language already separates the two by the verb itself, and never drop it to shorten the string — the slot is wide and there is no length pressure. The two buttons must read as one opposition (discard it / keep it), not as two unrelated labels, and this label must never read as \"proceed with the reset\". NOT \"Continue fasting\" (window-closed screen — starts the NEXT fast) and NOT \"Keep going\" (streak card dismiss).",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "مواصلة هذا الصيام"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieses Fasten beibehalten"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mantener este ayuno"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Garder ce jeûne"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この断食を続ける"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "단식 유지"
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pozostaw ten post"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Залишити цей піст"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留这次断食"
          }
        }
      }
    },
