    "PlanEditor.confirm" : {
      "comment" : "Primary button of the plan editor sheet (PlanEditorSheet.swift:85): applies the fasting plan the user has just chosen. This CONFIRMS A CHOICE — do not use the locale's OK/acknowledgement lexeme here, even where the platform prefers it for the English word Done, and do not use a close/dismiss lexeme: nothing is being acknowledged and nothing is merely being closed. Split off the shared literal key 'Done'; the other half is Pro.restoredDone, the primary of the paywall's result panel, which keeps the Done lexeme for a reason of its own. Values are unchanged by this split — this key exists so the two surfaces can never drift into each other again.",
